  ('komodo-indonesia', '07A', 'Komodo', 'Indonesia', 'High-current pinnacles, manta trains and dragons ashore', 'live', 'verified', 'oceanAerial', 'Komodo — Indonesia (East Nusa Tenggara)', '{"liveaboard","adventure","diveglobal","ocean"}', '{}', '{"comfort","premier"}', null, 'emerging', '{"key_facts":["SE-monsoon dry-season liveaboard sea, May-October (north 30C, optimal viz)","High-current pinnacles Castle Rock + Crystal Rock (reef-hook dives)","Manta Alley / Manta Point manta cleaning + feeding sites","Komodo dragons ashore (Komodo NP) - the land add-on; fleet incl. Komodo Aggressor (reseller line held)","Komodo/NTT clear - the ''Poso'' carve-out was an error, removed); FCDO 7km Mt Lewotobi exclusion on Flores + Bali/Flores flight disruption (Labuan Bajo gateway is on Flores); chamber at Siloam Labuan Bajo (2018), Sanglah Bali fallback - verified 2026-08-09"],"safety":{"emergency":"112 / 118 ambulance (verify)","hospital":"Siloam Hospitals Labuan Bajo (Flores); Sanglah General Hospital, Denpasar Bali for serious care (verify)","hyperbaric":"Hyperbaric oxygen chamber at Siloam Hospitals Labuan Bajo (Flores) since 13 Oct 2018, first in East Nusa Tenggara (8-patient); fallback Sanglah General Hospital, Denpasar Bali, ~1.5h by air - confirm 24h readiness via operator/DAN (source: wetfrogdivers.com + komodoresort.com, 2026-08-09)","regional_hazard":"Labuan Bajo (Komodo gateway) is on Flores, outside the zone but exposed to flight disruption (gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/indonesia/regional-risks, 2026-08-09)","no_fly_after_diving":"18-24h (DAN)","malaria":"present in parts of Flores/NTT (verify)","yellow_fever":"only if arriving from an endemic country","fcdo":{"posture":"AREA-RESTRICTED","quotes":[],"url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/indonesia","read":"2026-08-31T18:23:08Z","page_updated":"2026-08-28T12:29:31+01:00","source_country":"indonesia","quotes_note":"not extracted by the join — a restricted-area clause is quoted by a human, never composed"},"pos