  ('raja-ampat-indonesia', '07A', 'Raja Ampat', 'Indonesia', 'The richest reef on the planet', 'live', 'verified', 'oceanAerial', 'Raja Ampat — Indonesia (Southwest Papua)', '{"liveaboard","adventure","diveglobal","ocean"}', '{}', '{"comfort","premier"}', null, 'emerging', '{"key_facts":["NW-monsoon liveaboard sea, ~Oct-April (calmest/clearest); avoid Jun-Jul; seasonal inverse of Komodo; water ~28-30C","Three regions: Dampier Strait (Cape Kri - single-dive fish-count record, Blue Magic, Sardine Reef, Manta Sandy), Misool (Boo Windows, Magic Mountain, Four Kings), Wayag/north","Manta cleaning stations: Manta Sandy (Dampier) + Magic Mountain/Shadow Reef (Misool)","Fleet: Raja Ampat Aggressor (reseller line held), Explorer Ventures (reseller line held), Emperor Harmoni/Raja Laut, Master Indo Master, luxury phinisi (Damai/Dewi Nusantara/Mermaid/Arenui/Coralia)","Raja Ampat/Southwest Papua outside both; FCDO points Papua caution at the highlands); nearest chamber Waisai but readiness not assured - evac to Manado/Bali; Wayag temporarily closed (verify) - all verified 2026-08-09"],"safety":{"emergency":"112 / 118 ambulance (verify)","hospital":"Waisai (Waigeo) clinic; Sorong for referral; serious care routes to Manado or Bali (verify)","hyperbaric":"Nearest chamber at Waisai (Waigeo), ~2-4h from sites (+62-951-3173358) but readiness NOT assured - no reliably operational chamber in Papua per dive-medicine sources; DAN-documented case evacuated a diver to Bali (~2,000 km, ~7h via Sorong); Manado the other referral. Confirm status + carry evacuation cover (source: papuaparadise.com + stayrajaampat.com, 2026-08-09)","regional_hazard":"LIVE: Wayag + Manyaifun/Batangpele reported temporarily closed over nickel-mining disputes - verify northern-route access (rajaampatbiodiversity.com, 2026-08-09)","no_fly_after_diving":"18-24h (DAN)","malaria":"present in Raja Ampat/Papua - discuss prophylaxis (verify)","yellow_fever":"only if arriving from an endemic country","fcdo":{"posture":"