ge, Deep Pine, Monkey Park) let you ski waist-deep powder between well-spaced birch without poaching or a permit, the rarest thing in Japanese skiing. Bookable: lift pass + guide. **TIER: comfort→premier · price band lift ~JPY 8,800/day; guide ~JPY 40,000–90,000/day (approx).** `[when: ski ~Dec–early May; tree-well risk — never alone]` Commission: school/guide 10–15%. draw_rank 1.","source":"https://www.kiroro.co.jp/en/","accessed":"2026-07-17"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"Kiroro Ski Resort Guide: Deep Powder, Club Med & Onsen (Hokkaido)","meta_description":"Plan Kiroro — Hokkaido''s snow-sure powder vault near Otaru and Sapporo: ~20 m of snow, 30 km of piste and legal tree skiing, ski-in Club Med Peak and Grand villages, Yu Kiroro luxury residences and onsen wellness, with real timing, safety and booking intel.","slug":"kiroro-japan","primary_keyword":"Kiroro ski resort guide","long_tail":["Kiroro snowfall tree skiing","Club Med Kiroro Peak Grand","Yu Kiroro residences","Kiroro from Sapporo New Chitose","Kiroro backcountry gates avalanche"],"search_language":"ja","local_keywords":["キロロ スキー場","キロロ パウダー ツリーラン","クラブメッド キロロ","Yu Kiroro 温泉","キロロ 札幌 アクセス"],"hreflang":["en","ja-JP"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-17","attribution":{"author":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"publisher":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World LLC"},"reviewed_by":{"type":"Organization","name":"TravelWell.World"},"digital_source_type":"CompositeWithTrainedAlgorithmicMediaDigitalSource","digital_source_vocab":"https://schema.org/IPTCDigitalSourceEnumeration","last_verified":"2026-07-17","last_verified_basis":"source_verified","verified_against":[{"name":"UK Foreign, Commonwealth & Development Office","url":"https://www.gov.uk/foreign-travel-advice/japan","read":"2026-08-20T14:47:35Z","source_updated":"2026-08-19T15:40:39+01:00"}]}},"booking":{"codes":[],"note":"main risk at Kiroro is the deep-snow/avalanche environment, not security. Split em